st time. This is the product for that moment. You just rip the pouch, sprinkle into the bowl (not the tank), let it foam, flush. Done. It handles odours between deep cleans. For really tough stains a little scrubbing may be required, but this does the heavy lifting for you.\n\nPack it in a care package. Seriously.\u2028\nIn Canada you\u2019ll find it at Walmart, Shoppers, Superstore, Metro, Sobeys, Freshco, Fortinos, Home Depot, Jean Coutu, and Amazon. @ScrubbingBubblesCanada\n#EasyPeasy #ScrubbingBubbles #BathroomCleaning #BackToSchool CleanMySpace", "timestamp": "2026-08-17T12:46:09.000Z", "videoDuration": 54.099998, "videoPlayCount": 7382, "likesCount": 93, "commentsCount": 2, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fhsv1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/775858414_18615427993058971_1588812061644086836_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NTcxODk2ODY5NTcxOTM1MTE4NjE1NDI3OTg3MDU4OTcx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEzMjAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=vjmCe-ikMr8Q7kNvwEMk827&_nc_oc=AdoBU2F5TGqSTFVhV7w5fVMOIg-SRxpLLsWmKpyYW1pfbG75jRl9PoLjEdC_I0pBjm0&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fhsv1-1.fna&_nc_gid=lMTjYMie2_LcJUhRtxfGfA&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIHeYOpSXMM6eaNUq5wPlzqDFKRX8Z99DnsPnm3dtSt3Q&oe=6A9A1109", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fhsv1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQNuskycBvcQrkA1pWSCzuYCDHcGfly2kW5Z4bYp9PY6JcQmpOhfNWhcp1DU0OEu1IhquP1JteOqP8kFe4SjS_gbSHIFFUbx0UJZsHiR9IvPyw.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdrVNnp2I5P5DAisqlhqq3rfud4PV1GUaS3a_FatwRR8mLpczYDlYzlBPu0AO7e_hIg&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fhsv1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=JKvKHgZMmJ8Q7kNvwESE9i8&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=lMTjYMie2_LcJUhRtxfGfA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJV79aIoKaTp7UGC97MzT6gZmfHR16peL_AS-39rXS9sQ&oe=6A9A0B82", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "cleanmyspace", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "2723013581